WEBVTT

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.200
like: Bitcoin or Etherium?

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.776
Virtual reality or augmented reality?

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.296
I don't know if they were
taking bets or what.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:39.136
And as they got more comfortable with me,

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:42.376
they edged towards
their real question of concern.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.640
Alaska or New Zealand?

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:46.976
That's right.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.976
These tech billionaires
were asking a media theorist for advice

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.880
on where to put their doomsday bunkers.

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:55.736
We spent the rest of the hour
on the single question:

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:59.376
"How do I maintain control
of my security staff

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:00.720
after the event?"